Error [jet.MarkedFunctionValue]: `edit` can't be used as a function value because its parameter `value` is `&`
  --> tests/ui/ownership/named_write_and_move_functions_cannot_erase_access_as_function_values.jet:3:23
    |
  3 | run: fn() { callback: edit }
    |                       ^^^^
 Why: A function type gives each parameter plain read access unless it marks a write (`fn(&T)`) or a take (`fn(&&T)`), so a value of `edit` would drop the `&` its parameter declares
 Fix: Call `edit` directly, mark the parameter in the function type (`fn(&T)`), or pass a lambda that makes that call
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0227
